OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost to island air links
OL,4,Asubsidy rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have voted to keep the
OL,7,Fpublic subsidy for an island's air
OL,8,Flinks at #1.5m for 2027.
OL,10,FAlderney's representative to the States
OL,11,Fof Guernsey asked for an extra #364,000
OL,12,Fto bring the funding to a minimum of
OL,13,F#1.86m, but it was dismissed with 10
OL,14,Fdeputies voting in favour and 23 voting
OL,15,Fagainst.
OL,17,FAlex Snowdon, Alderney States member
OL,18,Fand representative to Guernsey, said an
OL,19,Faction plan needed to be drawn up to
OL,20,Faddress the "urgent crisis of aviation
OL,21,Fservices in Alderney".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
