OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost to island air links
OL,4,Asubsidy rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolicy & Resources vice-president,
OL,7,FYvonne Burford, said the committee had
OL,8,Fbudgeted #1.7m, an extra #200,000, in
OL,9,Flight of high fuel prices due to the
OL,10,FUS-Israel war with Iran.
